life are there on Earth right now?  How many have there been in the past?
At what rate is species extinction occuring?  Verifiable numbers only,
please.

What is the source of eco-fascist values?  Rousseau, as far as I can tell.
There's an excuse for having been Rousseau; there's no excuse for being
Rousseauean if one is to be as intellectually rigorous as the usual caliber
